# The study guides' pictures live in Supabase Storage (the public guide-images
# bucket, filled by study-guides/publish.cjs). Guides ask for /guides/img/...,
# so the pictures come through our own domain: ad blockers that block
# *.supabase.co do not hide them. Rules here run before those in netlify.toml.
/guides/img/*  https://boukmowybmtfqkinuvqj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/guide-images/:splat  200

# Question pictures in the public question-images bucket, at the same paths the
# question rows already name (images/<folder>/<file>), for the same reason.
/images/histo/*       https://boukmowybmtfqkinuvqj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/question-images/histo/:splat       200
/images/organelles/*  https://boukmowybmtfqkinuvqj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/question-images/organelles/:splat  200
